plain value: safe=true expected=true
value with CR: safe=false expected=false
value with LF: safe=false expected=false
value with CRLF: safe=false expected=false
value with NUL: safe=false expected=false
empty value: safe=true expected=true
response splitting via CRLF: refused=true kind=invalid
bare LF in a value: refused=true kind=invalid
colon in a header name: refused=true kind=invalid
well-formed header: refused=false kind=
status reason phrase: refused=true kind=too_large rounds=4
chunk extension name: refused=true kind=too_large rounds=3
